ife</source><publisher-loc>Edinburgh</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Churchill Livingstone</publisher-name><page-count count="232"/></citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn id="n102" fn-type="conflict"><p><bold>Competing Interests:</bold> The authors have declared that no competing interests exist.</p></fn><fn id="ack1" fn-type="con"><p><bold>Author contributions.</bold> The original idea for the study was conceived by GRB and modified by ANM. Data were collected in London by ANM, DAN, and GRB, and in Bangladesh by ANM. Logistical support and facilities were provided in Sylhet by OAC. Hormonal analyses were conducted by ANM, supervised by RTC who provided support for all laboratory work. Statistical analyses were performed by ANM. ANM and GRB drafted the manuscript, which was edited by RTC and OAC.</p></fn><fn id="n101" fn-type="financial-disclosure"><p><bold>Funding:</bold> Supported by a Royal Society University Research Fellowship to GRB, the Parkes Foundation (UK), University of London's Central Fund (UK), University College London Graduate School (UK) to ANM, the Robert Lurie Cancer Center, Northwestern University Medical School (USA), and the Sylhet Osmani Medical College, Bangladesh. The funders had no role in study design, data collection and analysis, decision to publish, or preparation of the manuscript.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>